cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or its results, cite the author and thesis title
  below and identify the repository version or commit used. This citation
  does not replace the citations required by BraTS, MONAI, nnU-Net, or
  other third-party components.
type: software
title: >-
  Development of Customized Three-Dimensional Models of Gliomas for
  Preoperative Anatomical Visualization
authors:
  - family-names: Mera Macias
    given-names: Yonny Josue
    affiliation: Yachay Tech University
abstract: >-
  Research software accompanying a biomedical engineering thesis on binary
  whole-tumor MRI segmentation, mask-based volumetry, and exploratory
  three-dimensional anatomical visualization. Includes patient-grouped
  five-fold evaluation of MONAI U-Net, SegResNet, and nnU-Net on 1250 studies
  from 1132 BraTS patients. The historical visualization prototype is
  distinguished from the final benchmark models.
keywords:
  - glioma
  - MRI
  - segmentation
  - BraTS
  - MONAI
  - nnU-Net
  - reproducibility
  - three-dimensional visualization
